      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/raster-format-conversion, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Re-encodes a raster coverage into another raster format, without altering its content.\"",
